        {
          "textRaw": "[m#] EventEmitter#emit",
          "name": "[m#]_eventemitter#emit",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "emit(eventName, ...args)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "emit",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**eventName** { [string](dataTypes#string) } - 事件名称 ",
                      "name": "**eventName**",
                      "type": " [string](dataTypes#string) ",
                      "desc": "事件名称"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**...args** { [...](documentation#可变参数)[any](dataTypes#any)[[]](documentation#可变参数) } - 传给每个监听器的参数 ",
                      "name": "**...args**",
                      "type": " [...](documentation#可变参数)[any](dataTypes#any)[[]](documentation#可变参数) ",
                      "desc": "传给每个监听器的参数"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [boolean](dataTypes#boolean) } - 调用时是否存在至少一个监听器 ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " [boolean](dataTypes#boolean) ",
                      "desc": "调用时是否存在至少一个监听器"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "eventName"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "...args"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>按监听器列表顺序执行或调度当前事件的监听器. <code>prependListener</code> 和 <code>prependOnceListener</code> 添加的监听器位于普通监听器之前.</p>\n<p>发射期间删除监听器不会从本次已经取得的监听器快照中移除它, 但会影响后续发射. 直接调用模式下, 监听器抛出的异常会向调用方传播, 且本次后续监听器不会继续执行.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let emitter = events.emitter();\n\nemitter.on(&#39;data&#39;, (value) =&gt; console.log(`second: ${value}`));\nemitter.prependListener(&#39;data&#39;, (value) =&gt; console.log(`first: ${value}`));\n\nconsole.log(emitter.emit(&#39;data&#39;, 1)); // true\nconsole.log(emitter.emit(&#39;missing&#39;)); // false\n</code></pre>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m#] EventEmitter#emit"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m#] EventEmitter#emitSticky",
          "name": "[m#]_eventemitter#emitsticky",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "emitSticky(eventName, ...args)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "emitSticky",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**eventName** { [string](dataTypes#string) } - 事件名称 ",
                      "name": "**eventName**",
                      "type": " [string](dataTypes#string) ",
                      "desc": "事件名称"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**...args** { [...](documentation#可变参数)[any](dataTypes#any)[[]](documentation#可变参数) } - 当前及后续监听器接收的参数 ",
                      "name": "**...args**",
                      "type": " [...](documentation#可变参数)[any](dataTypes#any)[[]](documentation#可变参数) ",
                      "desc": "当前及后续监听器接收的参数"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [boolean](dataTypes#boolean) } - 调用时是否存在至少一个监听器 ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " [boolean](dataTypes#boolean) ",
                      "desc": "调用时是否存在至少一个监听器"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "eventName"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "...args"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>先按 <a href=\"#m-eventemitteremit\">emit</a> 的规则发射事件, 再保存本次参数. 后续通过 <code>on</code> 或 <code>once</code> 添加的监听器会收到最近一次保存的参数.</p>\n<p>同一事件再次调用 <code>emitSticky</code> 会覆盖旧参数. 普通 <code>emit</code>, <code>removeListener</code> 和 <code>removeAllListeners</code> 都不会清除已保存的粘性参数. 当前没有清除粘性参数的公开方法.</p>\n<p>在直接调用模式下, 如果现有监听器抛出异常, 调用会在保存参数之前中断.</p>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m#] EventEmitter#emitSticky"
        },
